        "end_heading": "You thought you were giving someone really good tea.",
        "end_subheading": "You are.\nBut that’s only half the story.",
        "end_body": "<p>A minimum of 15% of Dilmah’s pre-tax profits is dedicated to helping people through the MJF Charitable Foundation and protecting nature through Dilmah Conservation.</p><p>So behind your Christmas gift are young people finding opportunity, women building livelihoods, wildlife being protected, forests being restored and orphaned baby elephants getting another chance at life in the wild.</p><p>That’s quite a lot of kindness to fit under one Christmas tree. But that is just the way we like it.</p>",
